  <h1>Haskell vs Rust</h1>
  <div class="artmeta"><span>Von Coldwast</span><span>Aktualisiert 20. Sep. 2026</span><span>9 Min. Lesezeit</span><span class="tag">#haskell</span><span class="tag">#rust</span></div>
